
Section
Tag="ENG"

[MapSettings]
LegendMap="October 20 2008.  2:30A.M.|Brooklyn, New York||A lot of abandoned buildings."
LegendMapInBrief="1. Kitchen Ground Floor||2.Laboratory 1st Floor||3.Living Room 2nd Floor||4.Shop Ground Floor||5.Office 1st Floor||6.CAID Secret Files"
ExpliMapInBriefSpy="The mercenary group known as Argus PMC are protecting a clandestine workshop that manufactures explosives.  It is a sheltered lot of buildings inside the Local Boss's Neighborhood."
ExpliMapInBriefSentry="Our customer asked us to protect their computer equipments in this poorly regarded neighborhood.  We count on your skill to protect the data from prowlers."
ModesStrings=((ExplicationModeSpy§(6553)="Neutralize 4 of the 6 mission objectives.",ExplicationModeSentry§(6550)="Protect the objectives and neutralize the intruders.",ExpliModeInBriefSpy§(6554)="The zone consists of 6 objectives. 5 Consoles, and one disk. You do not have access to the disk objective unless you activate the crane. You can also hack the security system to close the metal shutters on the windows for 30 seconds.",ExpliModeInBriefSentry§(6551)="The zone consists of 6 objectives to defend. 5 Consoles, and one disk. The spies don't have access to this last objective unless they hack the crane. The spies can also hack the security system  to close the metal shutters on the windows for 30 seconds.",LegendModeInBriefSentry§(6552)="The spies must accomplish a certain number of mission objectives. The latter can be of three kinds. The mercenaries must prevent them, or eliminate the spies.",LegendModeInBriefSpy§(6555)="The zone contains 5 consoles which can be neutralized and a disk to be stolen. To reach the last objective, you must smash through the wall by hacking the crane."),(ExplicationModeSpy§(6553)="Collect 10 Data Disks.",ExplicationModeSentry§(6550)="Protect the disks and kill the intruders.",ExpliModeInBriefSpy§(6554)="Use stealth to make your way around the mission zone, collecting the data disks.",ExpliModeInBriefSentry§(6551)="Defend the disks scattered throughout the mission zone.",LegendModeInBriefSentry§(6552)="The disks are spread throughout all three buildings as well ast the courtyard and backstreet.",LegendModeInBriefSpy§(6555)="The disks are spread throughout all three buildings as well ast the courtyard and backstreet."),(ExplicationModeSpy§(6553)="Locate and Kill all PMC Argus Mercanaries present.",ExplicationModeSentry§(6550)="Hunt down and kill all ShadowNet Spies.",ExpliModeInBriefSpy§(6554)="Use stealth, teamwork and misdirection to eliminate the Argus Mercs.",ExpliModeInBriefSentry§(6551)="Use your tactical advantages and your skill with weapons to kill all the spies.",LegendModeInBriefSentry§(6552)="Use the abundant amount of explosives to take down your pray",LegendModeInBriefSpy§(6555)="Be wary of the numerous explosives scattered around the mission zone. These are very dangerous, but with timing and skill can be used as an advantage."))